(7409259, 1167660, 47974, '<td valign="top">I really love this photo, from the concept to the processing.  My one complaint is the top right corner, it would be so perfect if you had the structure filling the entire frame.</td>', 'I really love this photo, from the concept to the processing.  My one complaint is the top right corner, it would be so perfect if you had the structure filling the entire frame.', '2015-10-09 18:24:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7409262, 1167624, 47974, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately you either took the photo to close or cropped to close.  This photo really needs a bit more behind the truck and good amount of empty space in front for it to head into.  It is just way to cramped for my taste.  Other then compositional taste, the rest of the photograph is magnificent.</td>', 'Unfortunately you either took the photo to close or cropped to close.  This photo really needs a bit more behind the truck and good amount of empty space in front for it to head into.  It is just way to cramped for my taste.  Other then compositional taste, the rest of the photograph is magnificent.', '2015-10-09 18:36:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7409263, 1167668, 47974, '<td valign="top">I wish you had shot this at a different time.  The entire fall is in shade and the dark trees to the left make it seem even darker.  The background has such wonderful colors and draws my eye to it vs the waterfall.</td>', 'I wish you had shot this at a different time.  The entire fall is in shade and the dark trees to the left make it seem even darker.  The background has such wonderful colors and draws my eye to it vs the waterfall.', '2015-10-09 18:38:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7409264, 1167652, 16912, '<td valign="top">Back again to comment. This is one of my tips for a ribbon (sorry, I''m not good at picking winners). Not your typical ''power'' shot but I see lots of energy in the image and the women has a serious ''power'' walk going on. Bumping +1</td>', 'Back again to comment. This is one of my tips for a ribbon (sorry, I''m not good at picking winners). Not your typical ''power'' shot but I see lots of energy in the image and the women has a serious ''power'' walk going on. Bumping +1', '2015-10-09 18:50:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7409265, 1167507, 16912, '<td valign="top">Yes, it meets the challenge in a loose sort of way. I''m strangely drawn to this and all that is going on in the nothingness.<br/> <br/>No super weird bling to hand out so you''ll have to make do with a bump of 1 (so a 7).</td>', 'Yes, it meets the challenge in a loose sort of way. I''m strangely drawn to this and all that is going on in the nothingness. No super weird bling to hand out so you''ll have to make do with a bump of 1 (so a 7).', '2015-10-09 18:53:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7409267, 1167683, 16912, '<td valign="top">This is taking minimalism to the extreme! On the technical side I think it''s lacking somewhat (big crop?).i think to show ''power'' here the bird should have been larger in the frame but as an art work I think it is cool. (+1 = 7).</td>', 'This is taking minimalism to the extreme! On the technical side I think it''s lacking somewhat (big crop?).i think to show ''power'' here the bird should have been larger in the frame but as an art work I think it is cool. (+1 = 7).', '2015-10-09 18:57:19.000000', NULL, 1),
