(7409961, 1167685, 124815, '<td valign="top">The curse of saturation and sharpening! I always look with interest to all landscapes and always wish for a personal view, without technical worries or pushed processing; the reason for my mark of 5</td>', 'The curse of saturation and sharpening! I always look with interest to all landscapes and always wish for a personal view, without technical worries or pushed processing; the reason for my mark of 5', '2015-10-14 16:03:03.000000', NULL, 1),
